+# CONTRACT — T8 Analytics Dashboard API
+
+## App bootstrap
+- [ ] `createApp` exported from `src/app.ts` and re-exported `src/index.ts` -> import works, returns Express app
+- [ ] App uses SQLite (better-sqlite3) initialized from `schema.sql` -> tables exist
+- [ ] `npm run build` compiles clean (strict, Node16) -> exit 0
+- [ ] `npm run lint` passes -> exit 0
+
+## 1. User Management
+- [ ] POST /auth/register {email,password} -> 201 + {token, user} ; auto-creates tenant if none given
+- [ ] POST /auth/register with existing email -> 409
+- [ ] POST /auth/register missing email/password -> 400
+- [ ] POST /auth/login {email,password} -> 200 + {token, user}
+- [ ] POST /auth/login wrong password -> 401
+- [ ] POST /auth/login unknown email -> 401
+- [ ] GET /auth/me with token -> 200 + own profile (no password_hash)
+- [ ] GET /auth/me without token -> 401
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role {role} as admin same tenant -> 200, role updated
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role as non-admin -> 403
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role for user in other tenant -> 404
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role invalid role -> 400
+
+## 2. Data Ingestion
+- [ ] POST /events {name,properties,timestamp} with token -> 201 + event, tenant_id = user's tenant
+- [ ] POST /events missing name -> 400
+- [ ] POST /events without token -> 401
+- [ ] POST /events/batch {events:[...]} -> 201 + {count}
+- [ ] POST /events/batch empty/invalid -> 400
+- [ ] Ingested event timestamp defaults to now when omitted
+
+## 3. Query Engine (tenant isolated)
+- [ ] POST /query/count {name} -> 200 + {count} only counts own tenant
+- [ ] POST /query/count with property filter -> respects filter
+- [ ] POST /query/count with from/to time range -> respects range
+- [ ] POST /query/timeseries {name,interval:'day'} -> 200 + buckets [{bucket,count}]
+- [ ] POST /query/breakdown {name,property:'url'} -> 200 + groups [{value,count}]
+- [ ] Queries without token -> 401
+- [ ] Tenant A cannot see tenant B events in count/timeseries/breakdown
+
+## 4. Dashboards (tenant scoped)
+- [ ] POST /dashboards {name,config} -> 201 + dashboard
+- [ ] GET /dashboards -> 200 + only own tenant's dashboards
+- [ ] GET /dashboards/:id -> 200 own ; 404 other tenant
+- [ ] PUT /dashboards/:id {name,config} -> 200 updated ; 404 other tenant
+- [ ] DELETE /dashboards/:id -> 204 ; subsequent GET -> 404
+- [ ] Dashboard routes without token -> 401
+
+## 5. Export (tenant scoped)
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=json -> 200 application/json array of own events
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=csv -> 200 text/csv with header row
+- [ ] GET /export/dashboards/:id?format=json -> 200 dashboard json
+- [ ] GET /export/dashboards/:id?format=csv -> 200 csv
+- [ ] Export without token -> 401
+- [ ] Export only returns own tenant data
